      "text": "The function \\( f \\) is twice differentiable for all real \\( x \\), with derivative \\( f'(x) = x^{3} - 6x^{2} + 5 \\). The function \\( g \\) is twice differentiable for all real \\( x \\), with derivative \\( g'(x) = (x - 2)e^{x} \\)."
